+            <dt pn="section-8.2.1-1.21">YResolution(283) = 100, 200, 300, 400. RATIONAL</dt>
+            <dd pn="section-8.2.1-1.22">
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-8.2.1-1.22.1">The resolution of the image is expressed in pixels per resolution
+unit. In pixels per inch, allowed XResolution values for all layers
+are: 100, 200, 300, and 400. MRC color fax mode requires the pixels
+to be square, hence YResolution must equal XResolution for all
